{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12415","headline":"送韦信爱子归觐 · 钱起","name":"送韦信爱子归觐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"离舟解缆到斜晖，春水东流燕北飞。\n才子学诗趋露冕，棠花含笑待斑衣。\n稍闻江树啼猨近，转觉山林过客稀。\n借问还珠盈合浦，何如鲤也入庭闱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12415.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12415","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}